proton-autogen (2.4.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * Improved executable detection and profile system
    - More robust classification for launchers, DX11/DX12 games, and legacy DX8/DX9 games
    - Better handling of ambiguous executable names

  * Environment profile isolation
    - Fixed issue where environment variables could leak between profiles
    - Strict separation between launcher, modern games, and old game profiles

  * Legacy game support improvements
    - Improved WineD3D profile for DX8/DX9 games (e.g. Unreal Tournament)
    - Correct handling of PROTON_USE_WINED3D and WINEDLLOVERRIDES for old games

  * Stability fixes
    - Fixed conflicts between launcher and oldgame profiles
    - Improved stability for Battle.net and related launchers
    - Fixed incorrect environment overrides affecting certain games

  * Compatibility improvements
    - Better support for GE-Proton environments
    - Improved compatibility with DXVK and VKD3D-Proton setups

  * Technical notes
    - Cleaner ESYNC/FSYNC handling per profile
    - Reduced unnecessary Vulkan/DXVK environment pollution

  * Support Legacy
    - Support legacy (Photoshop / ImageReady)

